  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0">
    <name>SEQ_Mode_Note</name>
    <x>1222</x>
    <y>212</y>
    <width>648</width>
    <height>22</height>
    <text>Physical operation uses guarded sequencer commands. Adaptive burns require GENERATE / LOAD and one-shot ARM + START.</text>
    <font>
      <font family="Liberation Sans" style="REGULAR" size="11.0" />
    </font>
    <foreground_color>
      <color red="105" green="115" blue="125" />
    </foreground_color>
    <transparent>true</transparent>
  </widget>

  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0">
    <name>Safety_Note</name>
    <x>30</x>
    <y>1005</y>
    <width>1120</width>
    <height>48</height>
    <text>Startup never enables source outputs or arms execution. Interlock permits are derived from confirmed hardware readbacks. MIXED switch masks (1 or 2) and unavailable inputs fail closed.</text>
    <font>
      <font family="Liberation Sans" style="REGULAR" size="12.0" />
    </font>
    <foreground_color>
      <color red="105" green="115" blue="125" />
    </foreground_color>
    <wrap_words>true</wrap_words>
    <transparent>true</transparent>
  </widget>

